  "method": "Downloaded the three Dryad files, solved the Dryad download challenge when it was presented, and read brain and body masses. Species ratios are medians of brain/body. Homo sapiens was compared with every other species under the pre-registered strict-superlative rule. Male and female human brain masses were compared only when the sex sample met the pre-registered floor. The mammal log-log residual is stored and was not read by the verdict rule.",
